     H option(*nodebugio:*srcstmt)
     H dftactgrp(*no) actgrp('QILE')

      *****************************************************************
      * FIXSY269 - List # of records in files containing FEIN/SS#
      *****************************************************************
      * REVISIONS:                                                    *
      *                                                               *
      *  03/06/25 C:333  Project WC2998                               *
      *                  Changes to CMS Settlement Reporting.         *
      *                  - Recompiled.                                *
      *                                                               *
      * 12/19/10 C:061 Project: SY269                                 *
      *                Created.                                       *
      *                                                               *
      *****************************************************************

      *** Output File
     FQSYSPRT   O    F  132        PRINTER OFLIND(*INOA)

     D Fnam            s             50    dim(558) ctdata perrcd(1)

     d x1              s              7  0
     d ##Fnam          s             10
     d ##text          s             50
     d ##NREC          s             10  0
     d ##Err           s              1


      *==============================================================
      *  MAIN LOOP
      *==============================================================

     c                   eval      x1 = 1

     c                   dow       x1 <= 558

     c                   if        Fnam(x1) <> *blanks
     c                   eval      ##Fnam = %trim(Fnam(x1))

     c                   call      'FIXSY269C'
     c                   parm                    ##Fnam
     c                   parm      *blanks       ##text
     c                   parm      *zero         ##Nrec
     c                   parm      *blank        ##Err

     c                   if        ##err = '0'
     c                   except    det
     c                   endif

     c                   endif

     c                   eval      x1 += 1
     c                   enddo

      *
     C                   SETON                                        LR
      *
      *
      *
     OQSYSPRT   E            DET            1
      *
     O                       ##Fnam
     O                       ##text            +010
     O                       ##NREC        3   +010
      *

